   "text": "\u2022 the repo is copied in\n\u2022 no internet, no extra privileges\n\u2022 FAKE secrets planted where\n  attackers look: AWS, SSH, GitHub,\n  npm and API keys\n\u2022 a FAKE machine name and user name\n  too\n\u2022 new random values every run, so a\n  leak points to one run\n\u2022 every scan also runs pip install,\n  setup.py, import and pytest, with\n  no AI",
   "originalText": "\u2022 the repo is copied in\n\u2022 no internet, no extra privileges\n\u2022 FAKE secrets planted where\n  attackers look: AWS, SSH, GitHub,\n  npm and API keys\n\u2022 a FAKE machine name and user name\n  too\n\u2022 new random values every run, so a\n  leak points to one run\n\u2022 every scan also runs pip install,\n  setup.py, import and pytest, with\n  no AI",
