   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "On our 11 attacks, Agent Trap flagged 11 and a plain code scanner 2: a sentence aimed at the AI, or code disguised as\ntelemetry, can't be seen by reading. On 11 real malicious PyPI packages it caught 4 stealing (one sent the fake API keys to\nwebhook.site) and flagged 6 as suspicious; on 20 popular open-source projects it raised no false alarms.",
   "originalText": "On our 11 attacks, Agent Trap flagged 11 and a plain code scanner 2: a sentence aimed at the AI, or code disguised as\ntelemetry, can't be seen by reading. On 11 real malicious PyPI packages it caught 4 stealing (one sent the fake API keys to\nwebhook.site) and flagged 6 as suspicious; on 20 popular open-source projects it raised no false alarms.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
